{
  "slug": "context-guardian",
  "name": "Context Guardian",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Automatic context window monitoring and smart compaction for Claude Code. Zero dependencies.\n\nContext Guardian (cg) watches your context window usage in real time via a statusline and provides on-demand compaction tools. When usage crosses a configurable threshold, the statusline turns red and recommends compaction - preserving your work and keeping Claude sharp.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (5): `compact` (Run Smart Compact — extract full conversation history, strip tool calls and noise), `config` (View or update Context Guardian configuration (threshold, max_tokens)), `handoff` (Save session context to a handoff file for cross-session continuity), `prune` (Run Keep Recent — drop oldest messages, keep last 10 exchanges), `stats` (Show current context window usage, threshold, and compaction recommendation)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install context-guardian@claude-community` from `Ricky-Stevens/context-guardian`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "wrapper",
  "wrapper": "skill",
